# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo for the 6T's cameras (cam6t=6): the back camera's frames through
# /dev/hakios-camera and src/camera_isp.c (with its colour tuning), then the front's; the last picture of each left
# for the host (xl camera: the front's, the last one kept).
/redwood/bin/devname
/redwood/bin/camera_test raw 90
/redwood/bin/camera_test raw 90 sensor 2
